  "title": "Qt: Set HighDpiScaleFactorRoundingPolicy before creating the app",
  "description": "QGuiApplication::setHighDpiScaleFactorRoundingPolicy is a static\nfunction that must be called before creating the application object,\naccording to the Qt documentation. Do so.\n\nOn recent Qt, there is a console warning if we attempt to set this\ninside the main application after creating the application (and\npossibly it has no effect.)\n\nNote that we really only need to do this on Qt 5.14 and 5.15,\nbecause the value we set it to is the default on Qt 6 or above.",
